+| `identity.consent-changed` | Emits | `consentId`, `personId`, `purpose` (ADR-0017) |
 
 ## Invariants
 
 - One person record per e-mail address. The e-mail is stored in lower case (T3-AC-003).
 - At most one ERP customer number per person (T3-AC-003).
 - ERP master data comes through the `integration` module, never from the ERP port.
+- A consent record is never changed or deleted. A new decision adds a record; the current decision is the latest record per purpose (T3-AC-004). `ConsentRepository` has no update and no delete.
+- Each consent record publishes one `identity.consent-changed` after it is stored.
 
